# Build context for `docker build -f Dockerfile.deploy` ONLY.
# BuildKit reads this instead of .dockerignore when Dockerfile.deploy is the
# build file — so this is the one build allowed to see the weights, and it
# sees NOTHING else (a stray multi-hundred-MB context would otherwise sneak
# back in through this door).
*
!models/
models/*
!models/model.onnx
